   #= > Keys =====================================================#
   # Navigate                                                     #
   #   j k    move                                                #
   #   Tab    next panel                                          #
   #   Enter  open                                                #
   #                                                              #
   # Act                                                          #
   #   m      merge into base                                     #
   #   r      rebase onto base                                    #
   #   x      discard worktree (not in --plain)                   #
   #   u      undo                                                #
   #                                                              #
   # Symbols                                                      #
   #   *      active agent                                        #
   #   ~      idle agent                                          #
   #   o      no agent or session ended                           #
   #   [!]    warning: the text beside it says why                #
   #                                                              #
   # --plain is read-only: actions need the full TUI.             #
   #                                                              #
   #                                                    Esc close #
   #==============================================================#

